User tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
PidFile /run/tor/tor.pid
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFileGroupReadable 0
ClientOnly 1
SafeLogging 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
RunAsDaemon 1
Log notice syslog
GeoIPFile /dev/null
GeoIPv6File /dev/null
DisableNetwork 0
